    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Team pages are still on template URLs"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "All 6 team pages carry the Wix placeholder sentence, and 4 of the 6 slugs render a different person: /team/brian-chung renders Alicia Branham."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
