      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "The selling pages are silent"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "5 of 22 sitemap pages carry any JSON-LD. /web-design-seo, the page that sells SEO, carries none; the blog is the exception at 15 of 15 sampled posts."
    },
    {
      "t": "text",
      "tag": "span",
      "cls": "n",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "The case-study build has no meta layer"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "marshmoore.com: 0 meta descriptions, 0 JSON-LD and 0 Open Graph tags across 36 pages, with /lines-represented/ live as “No Results Found”."
